  "text": "**Messi was the clear progression leader**: 567.1 in recorded progressive distance, with 25 progressive passes and 8 carries. Argentina’s advancement was heavily driven by his passing—not just midfield circulation. [[ev:sb:3869685:88]] [[ev:sb:3869685:3425]]\n\n**Mbappé led France**, recording 249.2 through 7 progressive passes and 9 carries—a more carry-led contribution. [[ev:sb:3869685:3315]] Behind him came Koundé at 191.2 and Tchouaméni at 184.6. [[ev:sb:3869685:2148]] [[ev:sb:3869685:2349]] Argentina’s supporting progressors were Acuña at 152.6 and Mac Allister at 150.0. These are distance rankings, not rankings of chance creation. [[ev:sb:3869685:3966]] [[ev:sb:3869685:2306]]",
